  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The reference Python API for end-to-end computational pathology from the University of Warwick TIA Centre — BSD-3-Clause, 526 stars, v2.0.1 March 2026. Covers the full pipeline from WSI loading through inference in a single consistent API, with pretrained models included. Complements QuPath (GUI) for teams building automated Python pipelines. Adopt for any team developing or deploying histopathology AI workflows.",
